  "notes": [
    "The byline 'Rik \"TRIUMPH\" Emmit' echoes Rik Emmett, guitarist and singer of the Canadian rock band Triumph (the handle); treated as a fan pseudonym, so the deck is credited to the handle TRIUMPH with no player page.",
    "Starting cards as posted under 'starting(9)': Carbon Chamber Testing / My Favorite Decoration, Imperial Arrest Order ('IAO'), Mobilization Points ('MOB.PTS'), All Wrapped Up ('AWU'), Jabba's Prize ('JPrize'), Prepared Defenses, Cloud City: Security Tower ('CCST'), Cloud City: Carbonite Chamber ('CCCC') and Carbonite Chamber Console ('CCConsole'); these count toward the total.",
    "Qty 61 as published (60 without Jabba's Prize, which the objective deploys at the start of the game). Section headers add up to 62: 'Characters(24)' lists 24 once 'BGleeBF w/ gun' is read as two cards, and 'Sites(8)' lists 7.",
    "Posted 'BGleeBF w/ gun' read as two cards, Brangus Glee and Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle (the only way the Characters section reaches its posted 24).",
    "Posted 'DB-' heads the docking-bay sites: 'Exe.', 'Coru.', 'End.', 'Tat.', 'CC.' and 'DSII' dested Executor: Docking Bay, Coruscant: Docking Bay (Special Edition), Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Tatooine: Docking Bay 94, Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) and Death Star II: Docking Bay (Dark versions). 'Tat.' could also be Tatooine: Mos Espa Docking Bay; Docking Bay 94 is the usual one. The '-----' separator line was removed.",
    "Posted 'V Lsaber' dested Vader's Lightsaber (Premiere); 'C-Freeze' (under Effects) dested the Effect Carbon-Freezing; 'OtGt Solo?' dested Oo-ta Goo-ta, Solo?; 'Omn/Its worse', 'AO/WW' and 'DF/HSmooch' dested the combo interrupts Ommni Box & It's Worse, Abyssin Ornament & Wounded Wookiee and Defensive Fire & Hutt Smooch; 'Ugn' dested Ugnaught; 'DPuhr' dested Djas Puhr; 'MJabba' dested Mighty Jabba and 'JT Hutt' Jabba The Hutt; 'B in Bus' dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth."
  ],
